      "description": "One smart-kg L2 `user-scenario` candidate per L1 recommendation, joined to a `persona` and a `business-process` by the edges smart-kg L2 already licenses, from an agent's `l1-scenario-mapping/v1`. Reuses the guide's own personas and processes, then smart-base's generic `DAK.Persona.*`; otherwise a glossary candidate or `could-not-determine`, each with a WARNING. Never invents a process.",
